 Extract data from the document into a JSON array of dictionaries. Do not infer unstated data; use "NA" if missing.
​Extraction Rules:
​Company Name: Primary company explicitly mentioned.
​CIN: MUST strictly match the 15-character format: 6 letters followed by 9 digits (e.g., BEMDBK401010000, representing a 2-letter country code + 4 letters + 3-digit country prefix + 6-digit client number sequence). Return "NA" if missing or if the format does not exactly match this sequence.
​Account Number: Extract all specific account numbers and return them as a list/array of strings (e.g., ["21345060", "21345052"]). If the document generally states "all accounts", return ["All accounts"].
​Account Currency: Mentioned currency (e.g., HKD, USD); otherwise "NA".
​Effective Date: Stated effective date, or fallback to meeting/resolution date.
​Expiry Date: Written expiry date or exact terms (e.g., "Until further notice").
​Output Format:
[
  {
    "Company Name": "",
    "CIN": "",
    "Account Number": [], 
    "Account Currency": "",
    "Effective Date": "",
    "Expiry Date": ""
  }
]
